OL,3,GNEWSA'Sizewell workers don't need to
OL,4,Awear uniforms to buy a sandwich'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSizewell C has "absolutely not" told
OL,7,Fworkers to avoid a town centre but
OL,8,Fsuggested they "probably" did not need
OL,9,Fto wear their uniforms when buying a
OL,10,Fsandwich, a manager said.
OL,12,FMarjorie Barnes, the head of community
OL,13,Frelations at the nuclear power station
OL,14,Fin Suffolk, denied workers had been
OL,15,Ftold to avoid Leiston after the town's
OL,16,Fcafe owners said there had been a fall
OL,17,Fin the number of constructors using
OL,18,Ftheir services.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
