OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Sizewell workers don't need to
OL,4,Awear uniforms to buy a sandwich'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrank Newsome, who owns Rosie's Coffee
OL,7,FLounge, said his takings had dropped by
OL,8,F40% since April, while Joanne Stanners,
OL,9,Fwho runs Darlings Cafe, said she feared
OL,10,Fhaving to close due to poor trade.
OL,12,FThe BBC understands advice was given to
OL,13,Fworkers about wearing high-visibility
OL,14,Funiforms while using the town's
OL,15,Ffacilities and driving HGVs during rush
OL,16,Fhour.
